      "description": "A World-Changing Company\n\u00a0\nPalantir builds the world\u2019s leading software for data-driven decisions and operations. By bringing the right data to the people who need it, our platforms empower our partners to develop lifesaving drugs, forecast supply chain disruptions, locate missing children, and more.\n\n\nThe Role\nForward Deployed Infrastructure Engineers (FDIEs) build, operate, and maintain the infrastructure that powers Palantir\u2019s platforms and production deployments. As an FDIE intern, you\u2019ll work alongside full-time FDIEs to deploy and operate Palantir software across real production environments, automate manual processes, and develop novel solutions to infrastructure challenges using tools like Foundry and Apollo. Every day looks different \u2014 you might be debugging a distributed systems issue, building automation to replace a manual runbook, or designing infrastructure improvements that scale across multiple deployments. You\u2019ll be treated as a full member of the team, with real ownership over the work you take on.\n",
